<ul><li>Full name</li><li>WhatsApp / phone number</li><li>Email (optional)</li><li>City of residence</li><li>Area of interest</li><li>Free-text message (optional)</li><li>Anonymized browsing data (cookies, IP address, device)</li></ul>
<h3>3. How we use your data</h3>
<ul><li>To contact you to schedule a consultation</li><li>To answer initial questions about procedures</li><li>For medical follow-up during and after treatment</li><li>For aggregated statistical analysis of website usage (without personal identification)</li></ul>
<h3>4. Sharing</h3>
<p>We do not share your data with third parties, except:</p>
<ul><li>When required by law or court order</li><li>With technical platforms necessary for operation (hosting server, email, WhatsApp Business), under a confidentiality agreement</li></ul>
<h3>5. Retention period</h3>
<ul><li>Active patients: for the duration of the clinical relationship plus the legally required period (medical records: 20 years, as required by the Federal Council of Medicine, CFM)</li><li>Contacts who do not become patients: 12 months, after which the data is deleted</li></ul>
<h3>6. Your rights</h3>
<p>You have the right to:</p>
<ul><li><strong>Access</strong> your data</li><li><strong>Correct</strong> inaccurate data</li><li><strong>Delete</strong> your data (except where retention is required by law)</li><li><strong>Data portability</strong></li><li><strong>Withdraw consent</strong> at any time</li></ul>
<h3>7. Cookies</h3>
<p>We use cookies for traffic analysis and to improve your experience. You can disable them in your browser settings. Categories used: <strong>strictly necessary</strong>, <strong>analytics</strong> (Google Analytics 4) and <strong>marketing</strong> (Meta Pixel, Google Ads).</p>
<h3>8. Security</h3>
<p>Data is transmitted via <strong>HTTPS (SSL)</strong> and stored on a server with restricted access. Regular encrypted backups are performed.</p>
